OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOvernight showers ease and low
OL,6,Fcloud in eastern areas lifts, leaving
OL,7,Fa dry day with sunny spells for many.
OL,8,FWinds become light, although feeling
OL,9,Fchillier than yesterday.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FOvernight showers ease and
OL,12,Flow cloud in eastern areas lifts,
OL,13,Fleaving a dry day with sunny spells
OL,14,Ffor many. Winds become light, although
OL,15,Ffeeling chillier than yesterday.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FFrost and fog patches clear
OL,18,Fleaving a dry day with sunny spells,
OL,19,Fbut heavy rain and gusty winds arrive
OL,20,Fin the southwest by the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
